! Positive-test mechanism: standard grouped PLOG terms.
! Two PLOG entries at 1 atm are summed before pressure interpolation.
ELEMENTS
H O N
END
SPECIES
H2 O2 H2O H O OH HO2 H2O2 N2
END
REACTIONS
O + H2  = OH + H         5.060E+04   2.67    6290.0
H + O2 = HO2             1.000E+12   0.00     500.0
    PLOG /  0.1   5.000E+11   0.10     400.0 /
    PLOG /  1.0   1.000E+12   0.00     500.0 /
    PLOG /  1.0   2.000E+12   0.00     600.0 /
    PLOG / 10.0   4.000E+12  -0.10     700.0 /
END
